{"t":"FANG","made":"2026-11-27 02:42","name":"Diamondback Energy, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas E&P","employees":1762,"hq":"Midland, TX, United States","website":"https://www.diamondbackenergy.com","summary_en":"Diamondback Energy, Inc., an independent oil and natural gas company, acquires, develops, explores, and exploits unconventional, onshore oil and natural gas reserves in the Permian Basin in West Texas, the United States. The company primarily focuses on the development of the Spraberry and Wolfcamp formations of the Midland Basin; and the Wolfcamp and Bone Spring formations of the Delaware Basin, both of which are part of the Permian Basin in West Texas and New Mexico. Diamondback Energy, Inc. was founded in 2007 and is headquartered in Midland, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"독립 석유 및 천연가스 회사인 Diamondback Energy, Inc.는 미국 서부 텍사스의 퍼미안 분지에서 비전통적인 육상 석유 및 천연가스 매장지를 인수, 개발, 탐사 및 활용합니다. 이 회사는 주로 Midland Basin의 Spraberry 및 Wolfcamp 지층 개발에 중점을 두고 있습니다. 그리고 서부 텍사스와 뉴멕시코의 페름기 분지의 일부인 델라웨어 분지의 울프캠프(Wolfcamp)와 뼈 스프링(Bone Spring) 형성물. Diamondback Energy, Inc.는 2007년에 설립되었으며 텍사스 주 미들랜드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":180.15,"mcap":50292084736.0,"pe":24.246298,"fpe":8.32325,"peg":1.0938,"ps":2.847474,"pb":1.2910091,"ev_ebitda":5.41,"div":2.62,"beta":0.468,"hi52":216.9,"lo52":139.41},"fin":{"rev":17661999104.0,"rev_g":0.32,"eps_g":0.621,"gross":0.73621005,"op":0.13883,"net":0.11618,"roe":0.04856,"fcf":6040374784.0,"cash":558000000.0,"debt":13230000128.0,"de":29.313,"eps":7.43,"feps":21.64419},"own":{"short":0.0382,"inst":0.74789,"insider":0.23955},"analyst":{"n":29,"mean":237.3793,"median":237.0,"high":266.0,"low":185.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.51613,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":20,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":21,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":5,"buy":21,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy